00:31:57,710 --> 00:32:02,670
FP&A is all about looking ahead and making smart decisions about the future.

778
00:32:02,890 --> 00:32:03,640
Got it.

779
00:32:03,660 --> 00:32:08,960
It involves things like forecasting budgeting and analyzing different financial scenarios.

780
00:32:09,180 --> 00:32:09,750
Okay.

781
00:32:09,770 --> 00:32:14,130
So imagine you're running a business and you're thinking about launching a new product.

782
00:32:14,310 --> 00:32:14,950
Okay.

783
00:32:14,930 --> 00:32:15,490
I'm following.

784
00:32:15,520 --> 00:32:28,470
You would use FP&A tools like breakeven analysis to figure out how many units you need to sell to cover your costs or cost benefit analysis to weigh the potential risks and rewards of that investment.

785
00:32:28,630 --> 00:32:29,050
Gotcha.

786
00:32:29,530 --> 00:32:36,850
So FP&A helps businesses make these strategic choices based on data and projections, not just gut feelings.

787
00:32:36,950 --> 00:32:37,860
Exactly.

788
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:39,440
What about breakeven analysis?

789
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:41,040
