00:33:42,680 --> 00:33:42,960
Okay.

812
00:33:42,980 --> 00:33:44,700
So debt is borrowed money.

813
00:33:45,080 --> 00:33:45,620
Exactly.

814
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:47,690
And equity represents ownership.

815
00:33:47,770 --> 00:33:49,230
Ownership in the company, yeah.

816
00:33:49,270 --> 00:33:49,410
Got it.

817
00:33:49,430 --> 00:33:50,430
Okay.

818
00:33:50,450 --> 00:33:50,790
Okay.

819
00:33:50,810 --> 00:33:58,780
So some companies might rely more on borrowing, while others prefer to raise funds by selling shares of ownership.

820
00:33:58,800 --> 00:33:59,340
That's right.

821
00:33:59,800 --> 00:34:01,700
What are the implications of those choices?

822
00:34:01,900 --> 00:34:03,360
That's where things get really interesting.

823
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:04,180
Okay.

824
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:07,710
A company with a high proportion of debt is said to be highly leveraged.

825
00:34:07,910 --> 00:34:08,670
Leveraged, okay.

826
00:34:08,690 --> 00:34:10,940
Leverage can magnify returns if things go well.

827
00:34:11,160 --> 00:34:11,420
Okay.

828
00:34:11,500 --> 00:34:12,900
