Dividends are a way for companies to share their profits with shareholders.

837
00:34:30,080 --> 00:34:30,360
OK.

838
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:33,420
Think of it as a reward for investing in the company.

839
00:34:33,440 --> 00:34:33,980
Gotcha.

840
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:36,910
Companies that are doing well and have some extra cash.

841
00:34:37,390 --> 00:34:39,640
might choose to pay dividends to their shareholders.

842
00:34:39,660 --> 00:34:42,140
