853
00:35:11,640 --> 00:35:22,410
We'll be looking at strategies like hedging, which is like financial insurance, to protect against potential losses and contingency plan, which involves preparing for those worst case scenarios.

854
00:35:22,850 --> 00:35:28,360
Understanding these concepts can help you make more informed decisions, whether you're an investor or a business owner.

