905
00:37:03,720 --> 00:37:06,750
Making sure they have enough cash to cover those short-term debts.

906
00:37:06,850 --> 00:37:07,350
Precisely.

907
00:37:07,830 --> 00:37:17,360
A healthy liquidity ratio means that a company can easily settle its immediate financial obligations like paying suppliers or meeting payroll.

908
00:37:17,620 --> 00:37:19,180
It indicates financial stability.

909
00:37:19,220 --> 00:37:19,460
Yes.

910
00:37:19,500 --> 00:37:22,380
It reduces the risk of those short-term cash crunches.

911
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:23,000
Exactly.

