00:37:59,160 --> 00:38:04,030
Asset allocation is a crucial concept for anyone looking to build a well-rounded portfolio.

932
00:38:04,350 --> 00:38:08,160
Asset allocation, I've heard that term thrown around a lot in the personal finance world.

933
00:38:08,440 --> 00:38:09,440
What does it actually mean?

934
00:38:09,580 --> 00:38:15,140
Imagine you have a basket of different assets, stocks, bonds, real estate, maybe even some gold.

935
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:20,450
Asset allocation is about deciding how much of your money you put into each of those asset classes.

936
00:38:20,470 --> 00:38:27,950
So it's about spreading your investments across different areas to manage risk and potentially maximize returns.

937
00:38:28,230 --> 00:38:35,900
