946
00:38:55,730 --> 00:39:01,300
So a higher ROE generally means that a company is effectively using shareholder money to generate profits.

947
00:39:01,840 --> 00:39:02,340
Exactly.

948
00:39:02,520 --> 00:39:05,420
If you're an investor, you want to see a company with a strong ROE.

949
00:39:05,640 --> 00:39:08,010
