It's about equipping yourself with the tools to understand this complex financial information, to participate in these meaningful conversations and to make informed decisions that can really impact your personal and professional life.

1081
00:45:07,510 --> 00:45:10,490
It's about empowering yourself in the world of finance.

1082
00:45:10,510 --> 00:45:14,180
And who knows, maybe you'll be the one explaining EBITDA to your friends and family.

1083
00:45:14,360 --> 00:45:14,780
