Yeah, it is.

1163
00:47:53,990 --> 00:47:56,970
It means really looking under the hood before you make a decision.

1164
00:47:57,250 --> 00:47:57,870
Exactly.

1165
00:47:57,910 --> 00:47:59,970
Due diligence can be tough, though, can't it?

1166
00:48:00,300 --> 00:48:00,800
It can be.

1167
