1179
00:48:17,550 --> 00:48:19,330
Well, you've got to ask the right questions.

1180
00:48:19,390 --> 00:48:19,490
Okay.

1181
00:48:19,910 --> 00:48:22,370
Look for anything that doesn't add up.

1182
00:48:22,390 --> 00:48:22,750
Uh-huh.

1183
00:48:22,770 --> 00:48:25,150
And sometimes you've got to trust your gut.

1184
00:48:25,610 --> 00:48:26,160
Gut feeling.

1185
00:48:26,640 --> 00:48:26,820
Yep.

1186
00:48:27,280 --> 00:48:28,040
That makes sense.

1187
00:48:28,060 --> 00:48:29,500
Sometimes it's all you've got.

1188
00:48:29,760 --> 00:48:30,100
Okay.

1189
00:48:30,120 --> 00:48:32,160
Let's talk about a term that gets thrown around a lot.

1190
00:48:32,320 --> 00:48:32,860
Okay.

1191
00:48:33,250 --> 00:48:34,640
market capitalization.

1192
00:48:35,520 --> 00:48:37,110
Ah, yes, market cap.

1193
00:48:37,310 --> 00:48:40,300
People say it's how much a company is worth.

1194
00:48:40,420 --> 00:48:40,760
Right.

1195
00:48:41,080 --> 00:48:42,700
But it can be a little misleading, can't it?

1196
