And companies that are growing really fast.

1199
00:48:47,690 --> 00:48:47,970
Right.

1200
00:48:48,270 --> 00:48:50,590
But maybe not making much money yet.

1201
00:48:50,710 --> 00:48:51,150
Exactly.

1202
00:48:51,170 --> 00:48:53,940
Remember when Company X announced that new product?

1203
00:48:54,400 --> 00:48:55,100
Oh, yeah.

1204
00:48:55,120 --> 00:48:56,980
Their market cap went through the roof.

1205
00:48:57,040 --> 00:48:57,840
Styrocketed.

1206
