Even though they weren't even profitable yet.

1207
00:48:59,950 --> 00:49:00,690
Lots of hype.

1208
00:49:00,930 --> 00:49:01,610
So much hype.

1209
00:49:01,630 --> 00:49:02,810
Yeah, it didn't last.

1210
00:49:02,930 --> 00:49:05,310
