Absolutely.

1214
00:49:09,700 --> 00:49:11,570
And the overall economy.

1215
00:49:11,670 --> 00:49:12,650
The big picture.

1216
00:49:12,710 --> 00:49:13,450
Exactly.

1217
00:49:13,470 --> 00:49:14,450
Important to keep in mind.

1218
00:49:14,510 --> 00:49:16,360
