You need to know a company's fiscal year.

1239
00:49:44,020 --> 00:49:44,900
Yeah.

1240
00:49:44,920 --> 00:49:47,350
To understand their financial statements.

1241
00:49:47,770 --> 00:49:48,610
Absolutely.

1242
00:49:48,870 --> 00:49:49,850
You know what's interesting?

1243
00:49:50,030 --> 00:49:50,530
What's that?

1244
00:49:50,890 --> 00:49:53,050
Thinking about your own personal fiscal year.

1245
00:49:53,930 --> 00:49:54,320
Oh, yeah.

1246
00:49:54,340 --> 00:49:54,430
Yeah.

1247
00:49:54,580 --> 00:49:56,810
When do you sit down and look at your money?

1248
00:49:57,150 --> 00:49:57,610
Good question.

1249
00:49:57,670 --> 00:49:58,810
When do you make your budget?

1250
