Asset allocation.

1260
00:50:11,520 --> 00:50:13,610
Don't put all your eggs in one basket right.

1261
00:50:14,310 --> 00:50:15,090
That's the idea.

1262
00:50:15,170 --> 00:50:17,140
That's basically what asset allocation is all about.

1263
00:50:17,380 --> 00:50:17,960
You got it.

1264
00:50:18,080 --> 00:50:19,880
You got to spread your investments around.

1265
00:50:19,920 --> 00:50:20,440
Yeah.

1266
00:50:20,460 --> 00:50:22,180
Stocks, bonds, real estate.

1267
00:50:22,290 --> 00:50:23,070
Reversification.

1268
00:50:23,110 --> 00:50:23,830
Reversification.

1269
00:50:23,850 --> 00:50:24,490
That's the key.

1270
00:50:24,710 --> 00:50:27,680
You want to balance out the risk and the potential rewards.

1271
00:50:27,720 --> 00:50:28,240
Yeah, Zach.

1272
00:50:28,560 --> 00:50:30,960
But there are so many different approaches to this.

1273
00:50:31,440 --> 00:50:33,470
There are a lot of different ways to do it.

1274
