And then there are target date funds.

1280
00:50:46,650 --> 00:50:46,990
Oh, yeah.

1281
00:50:47,230 --> 00:50:47,910
Those are popular.

1282
00:50:48,150 --> 00:50:50,450
They automatically adjust as you get closer to retirement.

1283
00:50:50,490 --> 00:50:50,950
That's right.

1284
